\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Forward! be our watchward,
\par Steps and voices joined;
\par Seek the things before us,
\par Not a look behind;
\par Burns the fiery pillar
\par At our army's head;
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Who shall dream of shrinking,
\par By our Captain led?
\par Foward through the desert,
\par Through the toil and fight;
\par Jordan flows before us,
\par Zion beams with light.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Glories upon glories
\par Hath our God prepared,
\par By the souls that love Him
\par One day to be shared;
\par Eye hath not beheld them
\par Ear hath never heard,
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Nor of these hath uttered
\par Thought for speech a word.
\par Foward, ever foward,
\par Clad in armour bright,
\par Till the veil be lifted,
\par Till our faith be sight.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Far o'er yon horizon
\par Rise the City towers,
\par Where our God abideth;
\par That fair home is ours:
\par Flash the gates with jasper,
\par Shine the streets with gold,
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Flows the gladdening river,
\par Shedding joys untold.
\par Thither, onward thither,
\par In the Spirit's might;
\par Pilgrims to your country,
\par Forward into light.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

